       "id": "3122211"
      }
     ],
     "value": "There are several alleles. The sequence shown is that of IMGT allele IGLC6*01 that is not represented on the reference genome assembly (GRCh38/hg38) and that is the only functional. The other existing alleles are pseudogenes. The sequence shown on the reference genome assembly (GRCh38/hg38) is that of IMGT allele IGLC6*05 that is a pseudogene due to a stop codon polymorphism at position 71"
    }
   ],
